    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka Sulemani yalakana nomuruchi Huramu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sulemani yarakhwo omwoyo okhuumbashila eliira liOMWAMI inzu, nende inzu yoburuchi yibe eyiye omwene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sulemani naraho abandu ebikhumila amakhumi musaafu okhuchinganga emisiiko, nebikhumila amakhumi munaane abaremi abomubikulu, nabasinjilili babwe ebikhumila bitaru nebikhumi bisasaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sulemani nakhupila Huramu omuruchi waTiro omunwa, ari Shinga olwa wakholela Daudi papa, nomuleerela emisiita okhwiyumbashila inzu okhumenyamwo, kho ukholele siesi orio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lola, endi okhuumbashila eliira liOMWAMI Nyasaye wanje inzu, okhuchimwahulila, nokhusambila imbeliwe amalesi kelibuuliesi, akamalesi keshing'aari, nokhuhaaniIamwo emikaate chiokhubaho chiakhatsotso, nokhumalilamwo emisango emisambe mutsuli nomungoloobe, khutsisabato, nokhukhuchaaka khwemiesi, nokhunduukho tsiamasabo kOMWAMI Nyasaye weefwe, shinga olwa kalachilisibwa muIsiraeli, obushia nobushia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inzu eya endi okhuumbakha yilaba ikhongo; okhuba Nyasaye weefwe nomukhongo okhushila abanyasaye bosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne niwina owakhanyala okhumuumbashila inzu, olwa likulu, kata likulu elili hekulu mwikulu, shilimuhela ta? Kho nasi nisie wina, mbu ndakhamuumbashila inzu, habula khulwa okhumusambilangamwo amalesi kelibuuliesi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho bulaano urumile omundu ouli omufundi okhukholela itsahaabu, neifeetsa, nomukasa, neshibia, netsingubo tsieisambarau netsiranzayi, netsieibuluu, khandi ouli omusitsa okhusaara tsisaare, abe nende abafundi aba endi ninabo eYuda neYerusalemu, aba papa Daudi yaleerayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi undeerele emisiita, nemitaraakwe, nemisandali, okhurula eLebanoni; okhuba emanyile shinga abasumbabo olwa bali abasitsa abamanya okhurema emisaala eLebanoni; ne lola, abasumba banje balabayo halala nabasumbabo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "okhungasilia emisaala eminji; okhuba inzu eya endi okhuumbakha yilaba ikhongo yamakana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi lola, ndalaheelesia abasumbabo abaremi abaremanga emisaala, tsikori ebikhumila amakhumi kabili tsieingano iswache, netsikori ebikhumila amakhumi kabili tsieishayiri, netsibaatsi ebikhumila amakhumi kabili tsieidivai, netsibaatsi ebikhumila amakhumi kabili tsiamafura.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Huramu omuruchi waTiro yahandiika likalusio naliyilila Sulemani; liri OMWAMI aheelanga abandube, niyeshichila nakhwemekha obe omuruchi wabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi Huramu naboola mbu OMWAMI Nyasaye waIsiraeli yeetsoomibwe, owalonga likulu nende eshialo, nowaheelesia Daudi omuruchi omwana omuchesi, ouli noburechelefu nobumanyilisii, mbu yoombashile OMWAMI inzu, nende inzu yoburuchi eyiye omwene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne bulaano ekhurumila omufundi ouli nobumanyilisii; niye Huramuabi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nomwana womukhasi omukooko waDani, ne samwana yali omundu weTiro; nomusitsa okhukholela itsahaabu, neifeetsa, nomukasa, neshibia, namachina, nemisaala, netsingubo tsieisambarau neibuluu neiranzayi, neikitani indorotoro; khandi okhusaara tsisaare tsietsimbia tsiosi, nokhukoora emikooro chindi chiosi; aheebwe obwikhalo halala nabafundibo, nende abafundi bomwami wanje Daudi so. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne bulaano ingano neishayiri namafura neidivai, ebia omwami wanje arumbuule, biyilwe ewabasumbabe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neefu khuIarema emisaala eLebanoni, chiosi echia wenya; mana khulakhuleerela eYafa, nikhuchibenjia khunyanza; nawe olachinga, noyila eYerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Sulemani nabala abarende bosi abali mushialo shiaIsiraeli, okhulonda khububali obwa Daudi samwana yababala; nibanyoolwa nibali ebikhumila eshikhumi namakhumi karaano nabitaru nende ebikhumi bisasaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne khubo yaraho ebikhumila amakhumi musaafu okhuchinganga emisiiko, nende ebikhumila amakhumi munaane abaremi abomubikulu, nabasinjilili ebikhumila bitaru nebikhumi bisasaba, okhukhosia abandu emilimo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
